# RTL & Urdu (Nastaliq)

Root: `lang="ur" dir="rtl"` on `<html>` — do not override without reason.  
Font: `Noto Nastaliq Urdu` via `DeferredUrduFont` + `fontFamily` in `tailwind.config.ts` / `globals.css`.

## Layout (logical CSS)
- Spacing: `ms-*` / `me-*` / `ps-*` / `pe-*` / `start-*` / `end-*` — **not** `ml-*` / `mr-*` / physical `left-*`/`right-*` for directional UI
- Icons: `rtl:rotate-180` on arrows/chevrons (or `TW_CTA_ARROW`)

## LTR islands (mixed content)
- Phone, email, URLs, Latin IDs, codes: wrap with `dir="ltr"` or `<bdi>` so digits/punctuation stay correct in RTL
- Sanity Studio fields for email/phone/URL → `LtrStringInput` (`sanity/components/LtrStringInput.tsx`)
- Do not set `dir="ltr"` on whole pages or large Urdu blocks

## Typography (Nastaliq)
| Concern | Rule |
|---------|------|
| Body / paragraphs | `leading-urdu` or `leading-relaxed` (**≥1.9**) |
| Section / page titles | `leading-heading` / `leading-urdu-display` — avoid `leading-none` on multi-line Urdu |
| Card / compact titles | `leading-urdu-tight` |
| Tracking / kerning | **`tracking-normal` only** — never `tracking-tight`, `tracking-wide`, or `tracking-[-*]` (breaks joins) |
| Eyebrows / badges | No Latin `uppercase` + wide tracking on Urdu labels |
| Features | Body uses `kern` / `liga` / `calt` in `globals.css` — do not disable |
| Pill CTAs | Compact line-height OK (see button rules in `globals.css`) — body copy still ≥1.9 |
| Dates / numbers in UI | `formatPublishedDate()` / `Intl` with `ur-PK` — not English month names |

Authority for theme line-heights: `tailwind.config.ts` (`leading-urdu*`, remapped `tight`/`relaxed`).

## A11y & interaction
- Touch ≥44×44px — `TW_TOUCH` / `min-h-11` / `min-w-11`
- Visible `:focus-visible` ring — never bare `outline-none` alone
- Decorative images: `alt=""`; content images: Urdu `alt`
- Form tel/email: appropriate `type` + `inputMode` (`tel`, `email`)
- Dates in UI → `formatPublishedDate()` (`ur-PK`)
- Responsive layout / overflow → `18-mobile-first-responsive.mdc` · UX → `19-ui-ux.mdc`

## Copy
**All user-visible text in Urdu.** Run `npm run check:urdu`. False positive: `// urdu-ok`  
Full allow/deny: `CLAUDE.md` § Urdu-First Frontend Rule.

## Motion
`prefers-reduced-motion` in `Reveal` + `globals.css`. Hover translate: add `motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0`.  
No-JS: `@media (scripting: none)` keeps Reveal visible.

Skill: `rtl-check` after nav/layout/typography changes.
